2314270/extras/b529f395fd7f8ebf9cf51e8f922a1fe0.poster.avif?t=1740529870\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314270/extras/b529f395fd7f8ebf9cf51e8f922a1fe0.webm?t=1740529870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314270/extras/b529f395fd7f8ebf9cf51e8f922a1fe0.mp4?t=1740529870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>I'm not a gamemaker professional but I hope you like it :)<br><br><strong>Controls:</strong><br><br><strong>Right Arrow:</strong> Walk right<br><br><strong>Left Arrow: </strong>Walk left<br><br><strong>Jump:</strong> Space<br><strong><br>Interact:</strong> E<br><br><strong>Play hook: </strong>Left mouse<br><br><strong>Build:</strong> Right Mouse<br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>HAS EXTRA CONTENT.</strong><br><br>Hope you like it!",
